# Config Rules

**Entry:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) · **Standards:** [RULES.md](../../RULES.md) §3.1–3.4 · **Deep dive:** [docs/ai/02-config-and-json.md](../../docs/ai/02-config-and-json.md)

## Scope

- `lib/config/` — Dart models (no Flutter widgets)
- `assets/config/*.json` — app definition

## Active file

`assets/config/mobile_production_v2.json` — matches `main.dart` → `_kActiveConfig`

## JSON shape

Top-level: `schemaVersion`, `app`, `theme`, `navigation`, `pages[]`

Page nodes: `id`, `type`, `props`, optional `style`, `tap`, `child`/`children`, `itemBuilder`

## Must

- Put UI/layout/copy changes in JSON (default UI change = JSON only)
- Use flat `props` (nest only via `data`, `tap`, tree children)
- Use `data.requestKey` + `requestUrl` for API-driven lists
- Add new routes to `pages[]` and `navigation` / `shellExcludeRoutes` as needed
- Match `requestUrl` paths to feature repos (see [RULES.md §3.5](../../RULES.md))

## Must not

- Add Flutter imports to `lib/config/`
- Create per-merchant Dart screen forks
- Reference obsolete configs (`classic.json`, `modern.json`) as active
- Patch prod JSON with new engine props unless the task allows — else [builder-specs](../../docs/engine/builder-specs/README.md)

## Models

`MobileAppConfig`, `ScreenConfig`, `ComponentConfig`, `NavigationConfig`
